      "content": "I'm not a doctor, but I can offer some general guidance. Lightheadedness and dizziness when standing up are common side effects of lisinopril, especially when first starting the medication. These symptoms are usually temporary and resolving on their own. However, taking a double dose is not recommended as it can increase the risk of side effects. Consider consulting your doctor or pharmacist for guidance on managing these symptoms and ensuring you're taking the correct dosage.",
